"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: https://github.com/Luna-Flow\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Parallel plans and workflow graphs for MoonBit, validated in MoonBit and executed by a native C runtime through the FFI."
msgstr "面向 MoonBit 的并行计划与工作流图：在 MoonBit 中验证，并通过 FFI 由原生 C 运行时执行。"

#: manual/api/backend/js.md:1
msgid "backend/js API"
msgstr "backend/js API"

#: manual/api/backend/js.md:3
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/backend/js`, imported as `@js`, is the placeholder for the JavaScript backend. It names its target and nothing more: it declares no foreign functions and executes nothing. It builds on every target."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/backend/js` 以 `@js` 导入，是 JavaScript 后端的占位包。它只给出自己的目标，别无其他：不声明任何外部函数，也不执行任何东西。它可以在所有目标上构建。"

#: manual/api/backend/js.md:10
msgid "Returns `JavaScript`."
msgstr "返回 `JavaScript`。"

#: manual/api/backend/js.md:18
msgid "Returns `Map`, the plan kind the backend would run first."
msgstr "返回 `Map`，即该后端会最先运行的计划种类。"

#: manual/api/backend/js.md:26
msgid "Returns `\"backend/js\"`."
msgstr "返回 `\"backend/js\"`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:1
msgid "backend/native API"
msgstr "backend/native API"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:3
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/backend/native`, imported as `@native`, is the C foreign function interface backend. It runs the integer kernels of the C runtime on MoonBit arrays, submits workflows to the C scheduler, and turns plans into typed native requests. It builds only for the `native` target and links the C runtime from its native stubs."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/backend/native` 以 `@native` 导入，是基于 C 外部函数接口的后端。它在 MoonBit 数组上运行 C 运行时的整数内核，把工作流提交给 C 调度器，并把计划转换为带类型的原生请求。它只能在 `native` 目标上构建，并通过原生桩链接 C 运行时。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:9
msgid "The enumerations of this package are read-only outside it: match on their constructors. The request records are built by the `*_from_plan` functions."
msgstr "本包的枚举类型在包外是只读的：可以对其构造器做模式匹配。请求记录由 `*_from_plan` 函数构建。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:12
msgid "Backend information"
msgstr "后端信息"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:16
msgid "Returns `Native`."
msgstr "返回 `Native`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:24
msgid "Returns `Map`."
msgstr "返回 `Map`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:32
msgid "Returns `\"backend/native\"`."
msgstr "返回 `\"backend/native\"`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:40
msgid "Returns `true`."
msgstr "返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:46
msgid "The value is a constant. The `moon` build compiles the C stubs without OpenMP, so in that build the kernels run on the calling thread; see the [native backend design](../../design/backend/native.md)."
msgstr "这个值是常量。`moon` 构建在编译 C 桩时没有启用 OpenMP，因此在该构建中内核运行在调用线程上；参见[原生后端设计](../../design/backend/native.md)。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:50
#: manual/design/backend/native.md:168
msgid "Kernels"
msgstr "内核"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:52
msgid "All kernels take a `FixedArray[Int]` of length $n$, a worker count $w$ and a chunk size $c$, block until they finish, and leave the input unchanged. They require"
msgstr "所有内核都接受一个长度为 $n$ 的 `FixedArray[Int]`、工作线程数 $w$ 和块大小 $c$，阻塞直到完成，并且不修改输入。它们要求"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:60
msgid "and fail with `InvalidArgument` otherwise. The facade functions of the same names in the [core API](../core.md) wrap these with optional arguments."
msgstr "否则以 `InvalidArgument` 失败。[core API](../core.md) 中同名的门面函数用可选参数包装了这些函数。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:65
msgid "Returns a new array with every element doubled, or `Overflow` when some $2 x_i$ does not fit in 32 bits."
msgstr "返回一个每个元素都翻倍的新数组；若某个 $2 x_i$ 超出 32 位范围，则返回 `Overflow`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:74
msgid "Returns the sum of the elements, or `0` on any failure."
msgstr "返回各元素之和，任何失败时返回 `0`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:80
msgid "The kernel adds each chunk from the left and then adds the chunk sums from the left, failing when any of these partial sums overflows. A returned non-zero value is the exact sum; `0` is either the sum or a failure."
msgstr "内核先从左到右累加每个块，再从左到右累加各块的和；只要其中任何一个部分和溢出就失败。返回的非零值就是精确的和；`0` 则既可能是和，也可能表示失败。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:86
msgid "Returns the inclusive prefix sums."
msgstr "返回包含式前缀和。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:92
msgid "It fails with `Overflow` when a partial sum overflows."
msgstr "若某个部分和溢出，则以 `Overflow` 失败。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:106
#: manual/api/core.md:298
#: manual/api/workflow.md:248
#: manual/design/backend/native.md:179
msgid "Workflows"
msgstr "工作流"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:110
msgid "Returns `true` when `@workflow.validate` finds no issue and the workflow's policy names the native backend."
msgstr "当 `@workflow.validate` 没有发现任何问题，且工作流的策略指定原生后端时，返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:119
msgid "Returns `@workflow.submit(workflow, backend=Native)`: a validated submission record. It does not run the workflow."
msgstr "返回 `@workflow.submit(workflow, backend=Native)`：一条经过验证的提交记录。它不会运行工作流。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:128
msgid "The state of a workflow in the C runtime."
msgstr "工作流在 C 运行时中的状态。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:140
msgid "`Submitted` holds until a worker takes the first node. The runtime never sets `Rejected`; a rejected submission yields an empty handle instead."
msgstr "在某个工作线程取走第一个节点之前，状态一直是 `Submitted`。运行时从不设置 `Rejected`；被拒绝的提交会得到一个空句柄。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:145
msgid "A snapshot of a workflow: its state, the runtime status code, the number of completed nodes and the id of the failed node (`-1` when none failed)."
msgstr "工作流的一个快照：状态、运行时状态码、已完成节点数，以及失败节点的 id（没有失败时为 `-1`）。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:157
msgid "`status` is one of the codes in the [architecture guide](../../architecture.md)."
msgstr "`status` 是[架构指南](../../architecture.md)中列出的状态码之一。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:159
msgid "`NativeWorkflowHandle` and `WorkflowHandle`"
msgstr "`NativeWorkflowHandle` 和 `WorkflowHandle`"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:161
msgid "An opaque pointer to a running workflow in the C runtime, and its MoonBit wrapper."
msgstr "指向 C 运行时中正在运行的工作流的不透明指针，及其 MoonBit 包装。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:175
msgid "Copies a workflow into flat integer arrays and starts it on the C scheduler with `worker_count` threads from its policy."
msgstr "把工作流复制为扁平的整数数组，并以其策略中的 `worker_count` 个线程在 C 调度器上启动它。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:182
msgid "The workflow is not validated in MoonBit; the C runtime checks it and, when it rejects the graph, returns an empty handle. The function always returns `Ok`. Compute nodes are scheduled, but their plans are not executed."
msgstr "工作流不会在 MoonBit 中验证；由 C 运行时检查，若拒绝该图则返回空句柄。该函数总是返回 `Ok`。计算节点会被调度，但其计划不会被执行。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:186
msgid "[!WARNING] The C bridge frees the request arrays after the runtime has started, while the worker threads still read them. This is a known defect that makes programs crash intermittently. Treat this function as experimental."
msgstr "[!WARNING] C 桥接层在运行时启动后就释放了请求数组，而工作线程仍在读取它们。这是一个已知缺陷，会让程序间歇性崩溃。请把这个函数视为实验性的。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:193
msgid "Returns a snapshot without waiting."
msgstr "不等待，直接返回一个快照。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:201
msgid "Waits until the workflow is `Completed` or `Failed` and returns the snapshot."
msgstr "等待工作流进入 `Completed` 或 `Failed`，然后返回快照。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:207
msgid "On an empty handle it returns at once with state `Submitted` and status `7`. It does not return if the workflow deadlocks."
msgstr "对空句柄，它会立即返回，状态为 `Submitted`，状态码为 `7`。如果工作流发生死锁，它不会返回。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:212
msgid "Stops and joins the runtime threads and frees the workflow. Call it once per handle; it does nothing for an empty handle."
msgstr "停止并汇合运行时线程，然后释放工作流。每个句柄只调用一次；对空句柄不做任何事。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:219
msgid "Typed native requests"
msgstr "带类型的原生请求"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:221
msgid "`NativeValueType` and `NativeReductionKernel`"
msgstr "`NativeValueType` 和 `NativeReductionKernel`"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:223
msgid "The value types and reduction kernels the C runtime implements."
msgstr "C 运行时实现的值类型和归约内核。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:240
msgid "Why a plan could not become a native request, or why a kernel failed."
msgstr "计划无法转换为原生请求的原因，或内核失败的原因。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:253
msgid "`NativeMapRequest`, `NativeReduceRequest` and `NativeScanRequest`"
msgstr "`NativeMapRequest`、`NativeReduceRequest` 和 `NativeScanRequest`"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:255
msgid "Typed counterparts of the C request structs."
msgstr "C 请求结构体的带类型对应物。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:288
msgid "The `input` and `output` buffers of requests built from plans are `NativeBuffer::new(0, 0)`: a plan describes the shape of the data, not the data. No function of the module sends these records to C; they are the validated description that a future executor will fill with buffers."
msgstr "由计划构建的请求，其 `input` 和 `output` 缓冲区都是 `NativeBuffer::new(0, 0)`：计划描述的是数据的形状，而不是数据本身。本模块中没有任何函数把这些记录发送给 C；它们是经过验证的描述，将来的执行器会为其填入缓冲区。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:295
msgid "Turns a `Map` plan into a `NativeMapRequest`."
msgstr "把 `Map` 计划转换为 `NativeMapRequest`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:301
msgid "It fails with `UnsupportedMode` when the plan is not a `Map` plan, and otherwise with the error mapped from the first issue of `@plan.validate`: value type, reduction kernel, backend and mode issues map to the error of the same name, `MissingReductionKernel` maps to `UnsupportedReductionKernel`, and the remaining issues map to `InvalidArgument`."
msgstr "若计划不是 `Map` 计划，则以 `UnsupportedMode` 失败；否则以 `@plan.validate` 的第一个问题所映射的错误失败：值类型、归约内核、后端和模式的问题映射为同名错误，`MissingReductionKernel` 映射为 `UnsupportedReductionKernel`，其余问题映射为 `InvalidArgument`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:309
msgid "Turns a `Reduce` or `MapReduce` plan into a `NativeReduceRequest`, with the same error rules."
msgstr "把 `Reduce` 或 `MapReduce` 计划转换为 `NativeReduceRequest`，错误规则相同。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:318
msgid "Turns a `Scan` plan into a `NativeScanRequest` whose kernel is `Sum`, with the same error rules."
msgstr "把 `Scan` 计划转换为内核为 `Sum` 的 `NativeScanRequest`，错误规则相同。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:325
msgid "`map_request_is_valid`, `reduce_request_is_valid` and `scan_request_is_valid`"
msgstr "`map_request_is_valid`、`reduce_request_is_valid` 和 `scan_request_is_valid`"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:327
msgid "Check the request fields the C validator also checks: positive element count, worker count and chunk size, a supported value type, and for scans the `Sum` kernel."
msgstr "检查 C 验证器同样会检查的请求字段：元素数、工作线程数和块大小为正，值类型受支持，对扫描还要求内核为 `Sum`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:337
msgid "`map_request_value_type`, `reduce_request_value_type`, `scan_request_value_type`, `reduce_request_kernel` and `scan_request_kernel`"
msgstr "`map_request_value_type`、`reduce_request_value_type`、`scan_request_value_type`、`reduce_request_kernel` 和 `scan_request_kernel`"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:339
msgid "Return the C codes of a request's value type (`0` for `I32`, `1` for `I64`) and kernel (`0` for `Sum`, `1` for `Min`, `2` for `Max`)."
msgstr "返回请求的值类型（`I32` 为 `0`，`I64` 为 `1`）和内核（`Sum` 为 `0`，`Min` 为 `1`，`Max` 为 `2`）的 C 编码。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:365
msgid "Raw foreign functions"
msgstr "原始外部函数"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:367
msgid "These `extern \"C\"` declarations are public so that callers can reach kernels the typed functions do not wrap, such as the `Int64` kernels and minimum and maximum reductions. Arrays are borrowed for the duration of the call. Map and scan return a status code and write into `output`, which must have at least `length` elements; reductions return the result, or `0` on failure. The arguments are the input, its length, the worker count and the chunk size."
msgstr "这些 `extern \"C\"` 声明是公开的，使调用者可以使用带类型函数没有包装的内核，例如 `Int64` 内核以及最小值和最大值归约。数组在调用期间被借用。映射和扫描返回状态码，并写入 `output`，它必须至少有 `length` 个元素；归约直接返回结果，失败时返回 `0`。参数依次是输入、其长度、工作线程数和块大小。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:374
msgid "`ffi_execute_map_i32` and `ffi_execute_map_i64`"
msgstr "`ffi_execute_map_i32` 和 `ffi_execute_map_i64`"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:376
msgid "Double every element into `output`."
msgstr "把每个元素翻倍后写入 `output`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:383
msgid "`ffi_execute_reduce_sum_i32`, `ffi_execute_reduce_sum_i64`, `ffi_execute_reduce_min_i32`, `ffi_execute_reduce_min_i64`, `ffi_execute_reduce_max_i32` and `ffi_execute_reduce_max_i64`"
msgstr "`ffi_execute_reduce_sum_i32`、`ffi_execute_reduce_sum_i64`、`ffi_execute_reduce_min_i32`、`ffi_execute_reduce_min_i64`、`ffi_execute_reduce_max_i32` 和 `ffi_execute_reduce_max_i64`"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:385
msgid "Return the sum, minimum or maximum of the input."
msgstr "返回输入的和、最小值或最大值。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:396
msgid "Minimum and maximum never overflow."
msgstr "最小值和最大值不会溢出。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:398
msgid "`ffi_execute_scan_sum_i32` and `ffi_execute_scan_sum_i64`"
msgstr "`ffi_execute_scan_sum_i32` 和 `ffi_execute_scan_sum_i64`"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:400
msgid "Write the inclusive prefix sums into `output`."
msgstr "把包含式前缀和写入 `output`。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:409
msgid "Starts a workflow from flat arrays: worker count; capability ids, kind codes and count; node ids, kind codes, capability ids (`-1` for none) and count; edge sources, targets, kind codes and count. Returns a null handle when the runtime rejects the graph."
msgstr "从扁平数组启动一个工作流：工作线程数；能力的 id、种类编码和数量；节点的 id、种类编码、能力 id（无则为 `-1`）和数量；边的起点、终点、种类编码和数量。运行时拒绝该图时返回空句柄。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:418
msgid "`ffi_workflow_poll_state`, `ffi_workflow_poll_status`, `ffi_workflow_poll_completed_nodes`, `ffi_workflow_poll_failed_node_id`, `ffi_workflow_wait_status` and `ffi_workflow_destroy`"
msgstr "`ffi_workflow_poll_state`、`ffi_workflow_poll_status`、`ffi_workflow_poll_completed_nodes`、`ffi_workflow_poll_failed_node_id`、`ffi_workflow_wait_status` 和 `ffi_workflow_destroy`"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:420
msgid "Read one field of a workflow snapshot, wait and return the final status, or destroy the workflow."
msgstr "读取工作流快照的一个字段、等待并返回最终状态，或销毁工作流。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:432
msgid "On a null handle the poll functions return `0`, `ffi_workflow_wait_status` returns `7` and `ffi_workflow_destroy` does nothing."
msgstr "对空句柄，轮询函数返回 `0`，`ffi_workflow_wait_status` 返回 `7`，`ffi_workflow_destroy` 不做任何事。"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:446
msgid "Equality"
msgstr "相等性"

#: manual/api/backend/native.md:450
msgid "Structural equality, promoted on `NativeMapRequest`, `NativeReduceRequest`, `NativeScanRequest`, `NativeReductionKernel`, `NativeRequestError`, `NativeValueType`, `WorkflowResult` and `WorkflowRuntimeState`. Use `==` and `!=`. `WorkflowHandle` has no equality."
msgstr "结构相等，作为方法提升到 `NativeMapRequest`、`NativeReduceRequest`、`NativeScanRequest`、`NativeReductionKernel`、`NativeRequestError`、`NativeValueType`、`WorkflowResult` 和 `WorkflowRuntimeState` 上。请使用 `==` 和 `!=`。`WorkflowHandle` 没有相等性。"

#: manual/api/core.md:1
msgid "core API"
msgstr "core API"

#: manual/api/core.md:3
msgid "The root package `Luna-Flow/luna_thread`, imported as `@luna_thread`, is the facade of the module. It re-exports the common constructors of `plan`, `shared` and `workflow` with defaults filled in, executes integer kernels on the native backend, and submits workflows. It builds only for the `native` target. Every function here is a thin wrapper; the linked package pages give the full semantics of the types it returns."
msgstr "根包 `Luna-Flow/luna_thread` 以 `@luna_thread` 导入，是本模块的门面。它重新导出 `plan`、`shared` 和 `workflow` 中常用的构造函数并填好默认值，在原生后端上执行整数内核，并提交工作流。它只能在 `native` 目标上构建。这里的每个函数都是一层薄包装；所链接的包页面给出了其返回类型的完整语义。"

#: manual/api/core.md:10
msgid "Module information"
msgstr "模块信息"

#: manual/api/core.md:14
msgid "Returns the fixed description `\"luna_thread MoonBit facade\"`."
msgstr "返回固定的描述 `\"luna_thread MoonBit facade\"`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:20
msgid "`root_plan_package` and `root_workflow_package`"
msgstr "`root_plan_package` 和 `root_workflow_package`"

#: manual/api/core.md:22
msgid "Return the names that the `plan` and `workflow` packages report for themselves, `\"plan\"` and `\"workflow\"`."
msgstr "返回 `plan` 和 `workflow` 包报告的自身名称，即 `\"plan\"` 和 `\"workflow\"`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:38
msgid "Policies and capabilities"
msgstr "策略与能力"

#: manual/api/core.md:42
msgid "Returns `Native`, the backend that plans, workflows and submissions use when none is given."
msgstr "返回 `Native`，即未指定后端时计划、工作流和提交所使用的后端。"

#: manual/api/core.md:51
msgid "Returns the default execution policy: native backend, synchronous mode, one worker, chunk size one, input order preserved. It is the same value as `@shared.native_policy()`."
msgstr "返回默认执行策略：原生后端、同步模式、一个工作线程、块大小为一、保持输入顺序。它与 `@shared.native_policy()` 是同一个值。"

#: manual/api/core.md:61
msgid "Builds a policy for the JavaScript backend. In v1 the policy constructor rejects every backend other than `Native`, so this function aborts; it is kept for the JavaScript backend that the specification describes."
msgstr "为 JavaScript 后端构建策略。在 v1 中，策略构造器拒绝 `Native` 以外的所有后端，因此这个函数会中止；保留它是为了规范中描述的 JavaScript 后端。"

#: manual/api/core.md:71
msgid "Builds an execution policy and checks it, returning the first problem as a `PolicyError`."
msgstr "构建一个执行策略并检查它，把第一个问题作为 `PolicyError` 返回。"

#: manual/api/core.md:78
msgid "The defaults are `Native`, `Synchronous`, `1`, `1` and `PreserveInputOrder`. The checks run in this order and the first failure is returned: `worker_count > 0`, `chunk_size > 0`, `backend == Native`, `mode == Synchronous`. The result is the same as `@shared.make_execution_policy`."
msgstr "默认值依次为 `Native`、`Synchronous`、`1`、`1` 和 `PreserveInputOrder`。检查按以下顺序进行并返回第一个失败：`worker_count > 0`、`chunk_size > 0`、`backend == Native`、`mode == Synchronous`。结果与 `@shared.make_execution_policy` 相同。"

#: manual/api/core.md:97
msgid "Returns the declared capability table of a backend; see `RuntimeCapabilities::for_backend` in the [shared API](shared.md)."
msgstr "返回后端声明的能力表；参见 [shared API](shared.md) 中的 `RuntimeCapabilities::for_backend`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:112
msgid "Value types and reduction kernels"
msgstr "值类型与归约内核"

#: manual/api/core.md:114
#: manual/api/plan.md:159
msgid "`i32_type`, `i64_type`, `f32_type`, `f64_type`, `bytes_type` and `opaque_type`"
msgstr "`i32_type`、`i64_type`、`f32_type`、`f64_type`、`bytes_type` 和 `opaque_type`"

#: manual/api/core.md:116
msgid "Return the element types `I32`, `I64`, `F32`, `F64`, `Bytes` and `Opaque(name)` of a plan's input domain. Only `I32` and `I64` pass validation in v1."
msgstr "返回计划输入域的元素类型 `I32`、`I64`、`F32`、`F64`、`Bytes` 和 `Opaque(name)`。在 v1 中只有 `I32` 和 `I64` 能通过验证。"

#: manual/api/core.md:129
msgid "`sum_reduction`, `min_reduction` and `max_reduction`"
msgstr "`sum_reduction`、`min_reduction` 和 `max_reduction`"

#: manual/api/core.md:131
msgid "Return the reduction kernels `Sum`, `Min` and `Max`, the three kernels that pass validation in v1."
msgstr "返回归约内核 `Sum`、`Min` 和 `Max`，即在 v1 中能通过验证的三个内核。"

#: manual/api/core.md:148
msgid "Plans"
msgstr "计划"

#: manual/api/core.md:152
msgid "Builds a map plan over `input_length` elements of one type."
msgstr "构建一个作用于 `input_length` 个同类型元素的映射计划。"

#: manual/api/core.md:158
msgid "The arguments are the label, the element type and the input length. The policy defaults to `default_policy()` and the ordering to `PreserveInputOrder`. The plan is not checked; call `validate` or `is_ready`."
msgstr "参数依次是标签、元素类型和输入长度。策略默认为 `default_policy()`，顺序默认为 `PreserveInputOrder`。计划不会被检查；请调用 `validate` 或 `is_ready`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:164
msgid "Builds a reduce plan that combines the input with a reduction kernel."
msgstr "构建一个用归约内核合并输入的归约计划。"

#: manual/api/core.md:170
msgid "The ordering of a reduce plan is always `PreserveInputOrder`."
msgstr "归约计划的顺序总是 `PreserveInputOrder`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:174
msgid "Builds a scan (prefix) plan."
msgstr "构建一个扫描（前缀）计划。"

#: manual/api/core.md:180
msgid "A scan has no reduction kernel in the plan and always preserves input order."
msgstr "扫描计划中没有归约内核，并且总是保持输入顺序。"

#: manual/api/core.md:184
msgid "Builds a plan that maps every element and then reduces the results."
msgstr "构建一个先映射每个元素、再归约结果的计划。"

#: manual/api/core.md:192
msgid "Returns every reason why a plan is outside the v1 subset, or an empty array."
msgstr "返回计划超出 v1 子集的所有原因，若没有则返回空数组。"

#: manual/api/core.md:198
msgid "This is `@plan.validate`; the [plan API](plan.md) lists the checks."
msgstr "这就是 `@plan.validate`；[plan API](plan.md) 列出了各项检查。"

#: manual/api/core.md:202
msgid "Returns `true` when `validate` finds no issue."
msgstr "当 `validate` 没有发现问题时返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:208
msgid "A ready plan satisfies the v1 rules, but the native kernels have one more requirement, the cover condition $w \\ge \\lceil n / c \\rceil$ described under `execute_map_i32`."
msgstr "就绪的计划满足 v1 的规则，但原生内核还有一个要求，即 `execute_map_i32` 下所述的覆盖条件 $w \\ge \\lceil n / c \\rceil$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:228
msgid "Direct execution"
msgstr "直接执行"

#: manual/api/core.md:230
msgid "These functions run a kernel of the native C runtime on a `FixedArray[Int]` and block until it finishes. They do not use plans. Let $n$ be the input length, $w$ the worker count and $c$ the chunk size. Every kernel requires"
msgstr "这些函数在 `FixedArray[Int]` 上运行原生 C 运行时的一个内核，并阻塞直到完成。它们不使用计划。设 $n$ 为输入长度，$w$ 为工作线程数，$c$ 为块大小。每个内核都要求"

#: manual/api/core.md:238
msgid "and otherwise fails with `InvalidArgument`. With the defaults $w = c = 1$ only an input of length one is accepted, so pass both arguments. The input is split into $\\lceil n / c \\rceil$ contiguous chunks whose sizes differ by at most one; the [native backend design](../design/backend/native.md) derives this and the results below."
msgstr "否则以 `InvalidArgument` 失败。使用默认值 $w = c = 1$ 时只接受长度为一的输入，所以请两个参数都传。输入被分成 $\\lceil n / c \\rceil$ 个连续的块，各块大小至多相差一；[原生后端设计](../design/backend/native.md)推导了这一点以及下面的结果。"

#: manual/api/core.md:246
msgid "Doubles every element, returning a new array, or `Overflow` when some $2 x_i$ does not fit in 32 bits."
msgstr "把每个元素翻倍并返回新数组；若某个 $2 x_i$ 超出 32 位范围，则返回 `Overflow`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:253
msgid "The input is not modified. The map is fixed to $x \\mapsto 2x$ in v1."
msgstr "输入不会被修改。在 v1 中映射固定为 $x \\mapsto 2x$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:257
msgid "Returns the sum of the elements."
msgstr "返回各元素之和。"

#: manual/api/core.md:263
msgid "The sum is exact when it is returned. On any failure, an invalid argument or an overflow of a partial sum, the function returns `0`, which cannot be told apart from a true sum of zero. Whether a partial sum overflows depends on the chunking: `[-1, 0, 2147483647, 1]` sums to `2147483647` with $w = 1, c = 4$ but returns `0` with $w = 2, c = 2$."
msgstr "返回的和总是精确的。任何失败（无效参数或部分和溢出）时，函数返回 `0`，这与真实的零和无法区分。部分和是否溢出取决于分块方式：`[-1, 0, 2147483647, 1]` 在 $w = 1, c = 4$ 时求得 `2147483647`，在 $w = 2, c = 2$ 时却返回 `0`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:271
msgid "Returns the inclusive prefix sums $y_i = x_0 + \\dots + x_i$."
msgstr "返回包含式前缀和 $y_i = x_0 + \\dots + x_i$。"

#: manual/api/core.md:277
msgid "It fails with `InvalidArgument` when the arguments break the conditions above and with `Overflow` when a partial sum overflows."
msgstr "参数违反上述条件时以 `InvalidArgument` 失败，部分和溢出时以 `Overflow` 失败。"

#: manual/api/core.md:302
msgid "Creates an empty workflow with a label and a policy (default `default_policy()`)."
msgstr "创建一个带标签和策略（默认为 `default_policy()`）的空工作流。"

#: manual/api/core.md:309
msgid "Add capabilities, nodes and edges with `Workflow::add_capability`, `Workflow::add_node` and `Workflow::add_edge` from the [workflow API](workflow.md). These methods change the workflow in place."
msgstr "使用 [workflow API](workflow.md) 中的 `Workflow::add_capability`、`Workflow::add_node` 和 `Workflow::add_edge` 添加能力、节点和边。这些方法会就地修改工作流。"

#: manual/api/core.md:313
msgid "`compute_task`, `spawn_task` and `join_task`"
msgstr "`compute_task`、`spawn_task` 和 `join_task`"

#: manual/api/core.md:315
msgid "Create a compute node that carries a plan, a spawn node and a join node."
msgstr "分别创建一个携带计划的计算节点、一个派生节点和一个汇合节点。"

#: manual/api/core.md:323
msgid "The first two arguments are the node id and label. None of these nodes needs a capability."
msgstr "前两个参数是节点 id 和标签。这些节点都不需要能力。"

#: manual/api/core.md:326
msgid "`channel_capability`, `mutex_capability` and `shared_read_capability`"
msgstr "`channel_capability`、`mutex_capability` 和 `shared_read_capability`"

#: manual/api/core.md:328
msgid "Create capabilities with the only access mode that is valid for their kind: a channel with `MoveOnly`, a mutex with `SynchronizeOnly` and a shared read view with `ReadOnly`."
msgstr "以各自种类唯一有效的访问模式创建能力：通道使用 `MoveOnly`，互斥锁使用 `SynchronizeOnly`，共享只读视图使用 `ReadOnly`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:338
msgid "`workflow_validate` and `workflow_is_ready`"
msgstr "`workflow_validate` 和 `workflow_is_ready`"

#: manual/api/core.md:340
msgid "Return the issues found by `@workflow.validate`, and whether there are none."
msgstr "返回 `@workflow.validate` 找到的问题，以及是否一个问题都没有。"

#: manual/api/core.md:349
msgid "Validates a workflow for a backend and records the outcome as a `Submission`."
msgstr "针对某个后端验证工作流，并把结果记录为 `Submission`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:355
msgid "The submission is accepted when the workflow has no issues and the backend is `Native`. Nothing is executed: `completed` is always `false`. Use `submit_workflow_async` to run a workflow."
msgstr "当工作流没有问题且后端为 `Native` 时，提交被接受。不会执行任何东西：`completed` 总是 `false`。要运行工作流，请使用 `submit_workflow_async`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:377
msgid "Asynchronous workflows"
msgstr "异步工作流"

#: manual/api/core.md:381
msgid "Starts a workflow on the native runtime and returns a handle at once."
msgstr "在原生运行时上启动一个工作流，并立即返回句柄。"

#: manual/api/core.md:387
msgid "The workflow is not validated in MoonBit first; the C runtime checks it. The current implementation always returns `Ok`. When the C runtime rejects the graph, the handle is empty and `wait_workflow` reports state `Submitted` with status `7` (`NullPointer`)."
msgstr "工作流不会先在 MoonBit 中验证，而是由 C 运行时检查。当前实现总是返回 `Ok`。当 C 运行时拒绝该图时，句柄为空，`wait_workflow` 报告状态 `Submitted`、状态码 `7`（`NullPointer`）。"

#: manual/api/core.md:392
msgid "[!WARNING] The C bridge frees the node, edge and capability arrays, and the request that points to them, as soon as the runtime has started, while the worker threads still read them. Tests that run workflows crash intermittently because of this. Treat asynchronous workflows as experimental until it is fixed."
msgstr "[!WARNING] 运行时一启动，C 桥接层就释放了节点、边和能力数组以及指向它们的请求，而工作线程仍在读取它们。因此运行工作流的测试会间歇性崩溃。在修复之前，请把异步工作流视为实验性功能。"

#: manual/api/core.md:400
msgid "Returns a snapshot of a running workflow without waiting."
msgstr "不等待，返回正在运行的工作流的快照。"

#: manual/api/core.md:408
msgid "Blocks until the workflow completes or fails, then returns its result."
msgstr "阻塞直到工作流完成或失败，然后返回其结果。"

#: manual/api/core.md:414
msgid "`status` is `0` on success or a runtime status code such as `14` (`BARRIER_BROKEN`); `completed_nodes` counts finished nodes and `failed_node_id` names the failing node, or is `-1`. A workflow whose nodes block without being woken never finishes, and `wait_workflow` does not return; see the [native backend design](../design/backend/native.md)."
msgstr "成功时 `status` 为 `0`，否则为运行时状态码，例如 `14`（`BARRIER_BROKEN`）；`completed_nodes` 统计已完成的节点，`failed_node_id` 指出失败的节点，或为 `-1`。若节点阻塞后从未被唤醒，工作流永远不会结束，`wait_workflow` 也不会返回；参见[原生后端设计](../design/backend/native.md)。"

#: manual/api/core.md:422
msgid "Stops the worker threads of a workflow and frees its runtime."
msgstr "停止工作流的工作线程并释放其运行时。"

#: manual/api/core.md:428
msgid "Call it exactly once per handle, after the last `poll_workflow` or `wait_workflow`."
msgstr "每个句柄恰好调用一次，且在最后一次 `poll_workflow` 或 `wait_workflow` 之后调用。"

#: manual/api/core.md:443
msgid "The last example is not compiled into the documentation tests because of the defect described under `submit_workflow_async`."
msgstr "由于 `submit_workflow_async` 下所述的缺陷，最后这个示例没有编译进文档测试。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:1
msgid "plan API"
msgstr "plan API"

#: manual/api/plan.md:3
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/plan`, imported as `@plan`, describes one data-parallel operation as a value: its kind, the element type and length of its input, the execution policy, an optional reduction kernel and an ordering guarantee. It validates plans against the v1 subset. It executes nothing and builds on every target."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/plan` 以 `@plan` 导入，把一个数据并行操作描述为一个值：它的种类、输入的元素类型和长度、执行策略、可选的归约内核以及顺序保证。它按 v1 子集验证计划。它不执行任何东西，可以在所有目标上构建。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:9
#: manual/api/shared.md:10
#: manual/api/workflow.md:9
msgid "The enumerations of this package are read-only outside it: match on their constructors, but build values with the functions below."
msgstr "本包的枚举类型在包外是只读的：可以对其构造器做模式匹配，但请用下面的函数构建值。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:12
msgid "Types"
msgstr "类型"

#: manual/api/plan.md:16
msgid "The four operations a plan can describe."
msgstr "计划可以描述的四种操作。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:27
msgid "`Map` applies a function to every element, `Reduce` combines all elements with a kernel, `Scan` produces the running combination (prefix), and `MapReduce` maps and then reduces."
msgstr "`Map` 对每个元素应用一个函数，`Reduce` 用内核合并所有元素，`Scan` 产生逐步累积的结果（前缀），`MapReduce` 先映射再归约。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:33
msgid "The element type of a plan's input."
msgstr "计划输入的元素类型。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:46
msgid "Only `I32` and `I64` are supported in v1."
msgstr "v1 只支持 `I32` 和 `I64`。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:50
msgid "The binary operation of a reduce, map-reduce or scan."
msgstr "归约、映射归约或扫描所用的二元运算。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:61
msgid "`Custom(name)` names a kernel that the runtime does not know; it never passes validation in v1."
msgstr "`Custom(name)` 指一个运行时不认识的内核；在 v1 中它永远无法通过验证。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:66
msgid "The element type and length of a plan's input."
msgstr "计划输入的元素类型和长度。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:78
msgid "`DataDomain::new(t, n)` stores its arguments unchecked; `validate` rejects $n \\le 0$."
msgstr "`DataDomain::new(t, n)` 不检查地保存参数；`validate` 会拒绝 $n \\le 0$。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:83
msgid "A complete plan."
msgstr "一个完整的计划。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:97
msgid "`Plan::new` stores its arguments unchecked. `policy` defaults to `@shared.native_policy()`, `reduction` to `None` and `ordering` to `PreserveInputOrder`. Use it for combinations the builders below do not make, such as a scan with relaxed ordering."
msgstr "`Plan::new` 不检查地保存参数。`policy` 默认为 `@shared.native_policy()`，`reduction` 默认为 `None`，`ordering` 默认为 `PreserveInputOrder`。下面的构建函数无法构造的组合（例如顺序宽松的扫描）可以用它来构造。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:102
msgid "`Plan::label`, `Plan::kind`, `Plan::domain`, `Plan::policy`, `Plan::reduction` and `Plan::ordering`"
msgstr "`Plan::label`、`Plan::kind`、`Plan::domain`、`Plan::policy`、`Plan::reduction` 和 `Plan::ordering`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:104
msgid "Return the fields of a plan."
msgstr "返回计划的各个字段。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:117
msgid "One reason why a plan is outside the v1 subset."
msgstr "计划超出 v1 子集的一个原因。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:134
msgid "`validate` describes when each one is reported."
msgstr "`validate` 说明了每种问题在何时报告。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:138
msgid "Structural equality, promoted as a method on every type of the package: `DataDomain`, `Plan`, `PlanKind`, `ReductionKernel`, `ValidationIssue` and `ValueType`. Use `==` and `!=`."
msgstr "结构相等，作为方法提升到本包的每个类型上：`DataDomain`、`Plan`、`PlanKind`、`ReductionKernel`、`ValidationIssue` 和 `ValueType`。请使用 `==` 和 `!=`。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:146
msgid "Constructors for enumerations"
msgstr "枚举的构造函数"

#: manual/api/plan.md:148
msgid "`map_plan_kind`, `reduce_plan_kind`, `scan_plan_kind` and `map_reduce_plan_kind`"
msgstr "`map_plan_kind`、`reduce_plan_kind`、`scan_plan_kind` 和 `map_reduce_plan_kind`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:150
msgid "Return `Map`, `Reduce`, `Scan` and `MapReduce`."
msgstr "返回 `Map`、`Reduce`、`Scan` 和 `MapReduce`。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:161
msgid "Return `I32`, `I64`, `F32`, `F64`, `Bytes` and `Opaque(name)`."
msgstr "返回 `I32`、`I64`、`F32`、`F64`、`Bytes` 和 `Opaque(name)`。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:172
msgid "`sum_reduction`, `min_reduction`, `max_reduction` and `custom_reduction`"
msgstr "`sum_reduction`、`min_reduction`、`max_reduction` 和 `custom_reduction`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:174
msgid "Return `Sum`, `Min`, `Max` and `Custom(name)`."
msgstr "返回 `Sum`、`Min`、`Max` 和 `Custom(name)`。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:191
msgid "Building plans"
msgstr "构建计划"

#: manual/api/plan.md:195
msgid "Builds a `Map` plan."
msgstr "构建一个 `Map` 计划。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:201
msgid "The arguments are the label, the element type and the input length; `policy` defaults to `@shared.native_policy()` and `ordering` to `PreserveInputOrder`. The reduction is `None`."
msgstr "参数依次是标签、元素类型和输入长度；`policy` 默认为 `@shared.native_policy()`，`ordering` 默认为 `PreserveInputOrder`。归约为 `None`。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:207
msgid "Builds a `Reduce` plan with a reduction kernel and `PreserveInputOrder`."
msgstr "构建一个带归约内核且顺序为 `PreserveInputOrder` 的 `Reduce` 计划。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:215
msgid "Builds a `Scan` plan with `PreserveInputOrder` and no reduction kernel."
msgstr "构建一个顺序为 `PreserveInputOrder` 且没有归约内核的 `Scan` 计划。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:221
msgid "The native scan kernel is a prefix sum, so a scan plan does not name its kernel."
msgstr "原生扫描内核就是前缀和，因此扫描计划不指定内核。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:226
msgid "Builds a `MapReduce` plan."
msgstr "构建一个 `MapReduce` 计划。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:242
#: manual/api/workflow.md:306
msgid "Validation"
msgstr "验证"

#: manual/api/plan.md:246
msgid "Returns every issue of a plan, in a fixed order, or an empty array."
msgstr "按固定顺序返回计划的所有问题，若没有则返回空数组。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:252
msgid "With $n$ the input length, $w$ the worker count and $c$ the chunk size of the policy, the checks are:"
msgstr "设 $n$ 为输入长度，$w$ 和 $c$ 为策略中的工作线程数和块大小，检查如下："

#: manual/api/plan.md:255
msgid "Issue"
msgstr "问题"

#: manual/api/plan.md:255
msgid "Reported when"
msgstr "报告条件"

#: manual/api/plan.md:258
msgid "the element type is not `I32` or `I64`"
msgstr "元素类型不是 `I32` 或 `I64`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:261
msgid "the policy's backend is not `Native`"
msgstr "策略的后端不是 `Native`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:262
msgid "the policy's mode is not `Synchronous`"
msgstr "策略的模式不是 `Synchronous`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:263
msgid "a `Reduce` or `MapReduce` plan has no kernel"
msgstr "`Reduce` 或 `MapReduce` 计划没有内核"

#: manual/api/plan.md:264
msgid "the kernel of a `Reduce` or `MapReduce` plan is `Custom`"
msgstr "`Reduce` 或 `MapReduce` 计划的内核是 `Custom`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:265
msgid "`UnsupportedOrdering` and `ScanRequiresStableOrdering`"
msgstr "`UnsupportedOrdering` 和 `ScanRequiresStableOrdering`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:265
msgid "a `Scan` plan has `RelaxedOrder`; both are reported"
msgstr "`Scan` 计划的顺序为 `RelaxedOrder`；两个问题都会报告"

#: manual/api/plan.md:267
msgid "`validate` does not check the cover condition $w \\ge \\lceil n / c \\rceil$ that the native kernels also require."
msgstr "`validate` 不检查原生内核同样要求的覆盖条件 $w \\ge \\lceil n / c \\rceil$。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:272
#: manual/api/workflow.md:372
msgid "Returns `true` when `validate` returns no issue."
msgstr "当 `validate` 没有返回任何问题时返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:278
msgid "`value_type_is_supported_in_v1`, `reduction_kernel_is_supported_in_v1` and `ordering_is_valid_for_kind`"
msgstr "`value_type_is_supported_in_v1`、`reduction_kernel_is_supported_in_v1` 和 `ordering_is_valid_for_kind`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:280
msgid "The individual v1 rules used by `validate`."
msgstr "`validate` 使用的各条 v1 规则。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:288
msgid "The first accepts `I32` and `I64`, the second `Sum`, `Min` and `Max`. The third accepts every ordering except `RelaxedOrder` for `Scan`."
msgstr "第一个接受 `I32` 和 `I64`，第二个接受 `Sum`、`Min` 和 `Max`。第三个接受除 `Scan` 的 `RelaxedOrder` 以外的所有顺序。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:308
msgid "Predicates"
msgstr "谓词"

#: manual/api/plan.md:310
msgid "`is_map`, `is_reduce`, `is_scan` and `is_map_reduce`"
msgstr "`is_map`、`is_reduce`、`is_scan` 和 `is_map_reduce`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:312
msgid "Test the kind of a plan."
msgstr "检查计划的种类。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:323
msgid "Returns `true` when the plan's kernel is `Some(Sum)`."
msgstr "当计划的内核为 `Some(Sum)` 时返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:329
msgid "`is_chunk_size_too_large`, `is_scan_requires_stable_ordering`, `is_unsupported_value_type`, `is_unsupported_reduction_kernel`, `is_unsupported_backend`, `is_unsupported_mode` and `is_unsupported_ordering`"
msgstr "`is_chunk_size_too_large`、`is_scan_requires_stable_ordering`、`is_unsupported_value_type`、`is_unsupported_reduction_kernel`、`is_unsupported_backend`、`is_unsupported_mode` 和 `is_unsupported_ordering`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:331
msgid "Test which issue a `ValidationIssue` is, for use with `Array::any`."
msgstr "判断一个 `ValidationIssue` 是哪种问题，可配合 `Array::any` 使用。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:343
msgid "`is_chunk_size_too_large` matches `ChunkSizeDoesNotFitInput`; the others match the issue of the same name."
msgstr "`is_chunk_size_too_large` 匹配 `ChunkSizeDoesNotFitInput`；其余的匹配同名问题。"

#: manual/api/plan.md:356
msgid "Package information"
msgstr "包信息"

#: manual/api/plan.md:358
msgid "`package_name` and `default_backend_label`"
msgstr "`package_name` 和 `default_backend_label`"

#: manual/api/plan.md:360
msgid "Return `\"plan\"` and the label of the default backend, `\"native\"`."
msgstr "返回 `\"plan\"` 以及默认后端的标签 `\"native\"`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:1
msgid "shared API"
msgstr "shared API"

#: manual/api/shared.md:3
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/shared`, imported as `@shared`, holds the vocabulary that every other package of the module uses: backend targets, execution modes, ordering guarantees, execution policies and their validation, the declared capabilities of each backend, native status codes, and integer-coded records that mirror the C request structs. It builds on every target."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/shared` 以 `@shared` 导入，包含本模块其他所有包都使用的词汇：后端目标、执行模式、顺序保证、执行策略及其验证、各后端声明的能力、原生状态码，以及镜像 C 请求结构体的整数编码记录。它可以在所有目标上构建。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:13
msgid "Targets, modes and orderings"
msgstr "目标、模式与顺序"

#: manual/api/shared.md:17
msgid "The runtime that executes a plan or workflow."
msgstr "执行计划或工作流的运行时。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:28
msgid "Whether a submission blocks until it finishes."
msgstr "提交是否阻塞到完成为止。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:39
msgid "Whether results must keep the order of the input."
msgstr "结果是否必须保持输入的顺序。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:48
msgid "`native_target`, `javascript_target`, `synchronous_mode`, `asynchronous_mode`, `preserve_input_order` and `relaxed_order`"
msgstr "`native_target`、`javascript_target`、`synchronous_mode`、`asynchronous_mode`、`preserve_input_order` 和 `relaxed_order`"

#: manual/api/shared.md:50
msgid "Return `Native`, `JavaScript`, `Synchronous`, `Asynchronous`, `PreserveInputOrder` and `RelaxedOrder`."
msgstr "返回 `Native`、`JavaScript`、`Synchronous`、`Asynchronous`、`PreserveInputOrder` 和 `RelaxedOrder`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:64
msgid "Returns `\"native\"` or `\"javascript\"`."
msgstr "返回 `\"native\"` 或 `\"javascript\"`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:77
msgid "Execution policies"
msgstr "执行策略"

#: manual/api/shared.md:81
msgid "How a plan or workflow should run: backend, mode, number of workers, chunk size and ordering."
msgstr "计划或工作流应如何运行：后端、模式、工作线程数、块大小和顺序。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:94
msgid "`PolicyIssue` and `PolicyError`"
msgstr "`PolicyIssue` 和 `PolicyError`"

#: manual/api/shared.md:96
msgid "A reason why a policy is outside the v1 subset, and the error that carries the first such reason."
msgstr "策略超出 v1 子集的一个原因，以及携带第一个此类原因的错误。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:114
msgid "Builds a policy and returns the first problem as a `PolicyError`."
msgstr "构建一个策略，并把第一个问题作为 `PolicyError` 返回。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:120
msgid "The defaults are `Native`, `Synchronous`, `1`, `1` and `PreserveInputOrder`. The checks run in the order `worker_count > 0`, `chunk_size > 0`, `backend == Native`, `mode == Synchronous`; the ordering is not checked."
msgstr "默认值依次为 `Native`、`Synchronous`、`1`、`1` 和 `PreserveInputOrder`。检查顺序为 `worker_count > 0`、`chunk_size > 0`、`backend == Native`、`mode == Synchronous`；顺序本身不检查。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:126
msgid "Builds a policy like `make_execution_policy` and aborts when it would return an error."
msgstr "像 `make_execution_policy` 那样构建策略，并在它会返回错误时中止。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:133
msgid "`native_policy` and `javascript_policy`"
msgstr "`native_policy` 和 `javascript_policy`"

#: manual/api/shared.md:135
msgid "Return the default native policy, and attempt the same for the JavaScript backend."
msgstr "返回默认的原生策略，以及为 JavaScript 后端做同样尝试的结果。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:143
msgid "`native_policy()` is `make_execution_policy().unwrap()`. `javascript_policy()` is `make_execution_policy(backend=JavaScript).unwrap()`, which aborts in v1 because the JavaScript backend is rejected."
msgstr "`native_policy()` 就是 `make_execution_policy().unwrap()`。`javascript_policy()` 是 `make_execution_policy(backend=JavaScript).unwrap()`，由于 JavaScript 后端被拒绝，它在 v1 中会中止。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:149
msgid "Returns every issue of an existing policy, in the order of the checks above."
msgstr "按上述检查的顺序返回已有策略的所有问题。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:155
msgid "Policies built with the functions above always pass; `validate_policy` matters for a policy stored in a workflow, which `@workflow.validate` re-checks."
msgstr "用上面的函数构建的策略总能通过检查；`validate_policy` 用于存放在工作流中的策略，`@workflow.validate` 会重新检查它。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:160
msgid "Returns `true` when the policy asks for more than one worker."
msgstr "当策略要求不止一个工作线程时返回 `true`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:180
msgid "Runtime capabilities"
msgstr "运行时能力"

#: manual/api/shared.md:184
msgid "The features a backend declares."
msgstr "后端声明的特性。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:197
msgid "Returns the declared table of a backend."
msgstr "返回后端声明的能力表。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:203
msgid "Backend"
msgstr "后端"

#: manual/api/shared.md:203
msgid "Parallelism"
msgstr "并行"

#: manual/api/shared.md:203
msgid "Async"
msgstr "异步"

#: manual/api/shared.md:203
msgid "Zero-copy buffers"
msgstr "零拷贝缓冲区"

#: manual/api/shared.md:208
msgid "The table is a fixed declaration, not a probe of the running system. The JavaScript entries describe the backend the specification plans; the JavaScript backend executes nothing yet."
msgstr "该表是固定的声明，而不是对运行中系统的探测。JavaScript 一行描述的是规范所规划的后端；JavaScript 后端目前什么也不执行。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:212
msgid "Native status codes"
msgstr "原生状态码"

#: manual/api/shared.md:216
msgid "The status codes 0 to 7 of the C runtime."
msgstr "C 运行时的状态码 0 到 7。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:231
msgid "`native_status_code` and `native_status_from_code`"
msgstr "`native_status_code` 和 `native_status_from_code`"

#: manual/api/shared.md:233
msgid "Convert between `NativeStatus` and its C code."
msgstr "在 `NativeStatus` 与其 C 编码之间转换。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:240
msgid "`native_status_code` numbers the constructors 0 to 7 in declaration order. `native_status_from_code` inverts it on 0 to 7 and maps every other code, including the workflow statuses 8 to 14, to `InvalidArgument`."
msgstr "`native_status_code` 按声明顺序把构造器编号为 0 到 7。`native_status_from_code` 在 0 到 7 上是它的逆，并把其他所有编码（包括工作流状态码 8 到 14）映射为 `InvalidArgument`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:255
msgid "Integer-coded native records"
msgstr "整数编码的原生记录"

#: manual/api/shared.md:257
msgid "These records mirror the C structs `luna_thread_buffer`, `luna_thread_map_request`, `luna_thread_reduce_request` and `luna_thread_scan_request` field by field, with enumerations as `Int` codes. No package of the module consumes them; `backend/native` uses its own typed records. They store their arguments unchecked."
msgstr "这些记录逐字段镜像 C 结构体 `luna_thread_buffer`、`luna_thread_map_request`、`luna_thread_reduce_request` 和 `luna_thread_scan_request`，枚举以 `Int` 编码表示。本模块中没有包使用它们；`backend/native` 使用自己的带类型记录。它们不检查地保存参数。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:265
msgid "A pointer, as an `Int`, and a length."
msgstr "一个以 `Int` 表示的指针和一个长度。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:279
msgid "Input and output buffers, element count, value type code, worker count and chunk size."
msgstr "输入和输出缓冲区、元素数、值类型编码、工作线程数和块大小。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:300
msgid "The constructor takes the fields in declaration order."
msgstr "构造函数按声明顺序接受各字段。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:302
msgid "`NativeReduceRequest` and `NativeScanRequest`"
msgstr "`NativeReduceRequest` 和 `NativeScanRequest`"

#: manual/api/shared.md:304
msgid "The same fields as `NativeMapRequest` plus a reduction kernel code, placed after the value type."
msgstr "字段与 `NativeMapRequest` 相同，另外在值类型之后多一个归约内核编码。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:354
#: manual/api/workflow.md:450
msgid "Equality and package information"
msgstr "相等性与包信息"

#: manual/api/shared.md:358
msgid "Structural equality, promoted on every type of the package: `BackendTarget`, `ExecutionMode`, `ExecutionPolicy`, `NativeBuffer`, `NativeMapRequest`, `NativeReduceRequest`, `NativeScanRequest`, `NativeStatus`, `OrderingGuarantee`, `PolicyError`, `PolicyIssue` and `RuntimeCapabilities`. Use `==` and `!=`."
msgstr "结构相等，作为方法提升到本包的每个类型上：`BackendTarget`、`ExecutionMode`、`ExecutionPolicy`、`NativeBuffer`、`NativeMapRequest`、`NativeReduceRequest`、`NativeScanRequest`、`NativeStatus`、`OrderingGuarantee`、`PolicyError`、`PolicyIssue` 和 `RuntimeCapabilities`。请使用 `==` 和 `!=`。"

#: manual/api/shared.md:370
msgid "Returns `\"shared\"`."
msgstr "返回 `\"shared\"`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:1
msgid "workflow API"
msgstr "workflow API"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:3
msgid "The package `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/workflow`, imported as `@workflow`, describes a task graph: a set of capabilities (channels, locks, barriers and shared data), a set of nodes that compute or synchronise, and dependency edges between nodes. It validates the graph and records submissions. It executes nothing itself and builds on every target; `backend/native` runs workflows."
msgstr "包 `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/workflow` 以 `@workflow` 导入，用于描述任务图：一组能力（通道、锁、屏障和共享数据）、一组进行计算或同步的节点，以及节点之间的依赖边。它验证图并记录提交。它本身不执行任何东西，可以在所有目标上构建；工作流由 `backend/native` 运行。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:12
msgid "Capabilities"
msgstr "能力"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:16
msgid "The kind of resource a capability stands for."
msgstr "能力所代表的资源种类。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:33
msgid "`Opaque(name)` is never supported. The native runtime additionally rejects `RwLock` and `Semaphore`."
msgstr "`Opaque(name)` 永远不受支持。原生运行时还会拒绝 `RwLock` 和 `Semaphore`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:38
msgid "How nodes may use a capability."
msgstr "节点可以如何使用能力。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:50
msgid "Each capability kind admits only some access modes:"
msgstr "每种能力只允许部分访问模式："

#: manual/api/workflow.md:52
msgid "Kind"
msgstr "种类"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:52
msgid "Valid access modes"
msgstr "有效的访问模式"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:59
#: manual/architecture.md:84
#: manual/architecture.md:85
#: manual/architecture.md:86
#: manual/architecture.md:87
#: manual/architecture.md:88
#: manual/architecture.md:89
#: manual/architecture.md:90
msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:63
msgid "A capability with an id, a label, a kind and an access mode."
msgstr "带有 id、标签、种类和访问模式的能力。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:75
msgid "`Capability::new` does not check the access mode; `validate` does."
msgstr "`Capability::new` 不检查访问模式；由 `validate` 检查。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:77
msgid "`owned_buffer_capability`, `shared_read_view_capability`, `atomic_cell_capability`, `mutex_capability`, `condvar_capability`, `rwlock_capability`, `semaphore_capability`, `barrier_capability`, `channel_capability` and `opaque_capability`"
msgstr "`owned_buffer_capability`、`shared_read_view_capability`、`atomic_cell_capability`、`mutex_capability`、`condvar_capability`、`rwlock_capability`、`semaphore_capability`、`barrier_capability`、`channel_capability` 和 `opaque_capability`"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:79
msgid "Return the capability kinds of the same names."
msgstr "返回同名的能力种类。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:94
msgid "`read_only_access`, `write_only_access`, `read_write_access`, `synchronize_only_access` and `move_only_access`"
msgstr "`read_only_access`、`write_only_access`、`read_write_access`、`synchronize_only_access` 和 `move_only_access`"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:96
msgid "Return the access modes of the same names."
msgstr "返回同名的访问模式。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:119
msgid "Nodes"
msgstr "节点"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:123
msgid "What a node does."
msgstr "节点做什么。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:142
msgid "`Compute`, `Spawn` and `Join` need no capability. The other kinds must name a capability of a matching kind:"
msgstr "`Compute`、`Spawn` 和 `Join` 不需要能力。其他种类必须指定一个种类匹配的能力："

#: manual/api/workflow.md:145
#: manual/architecture.md:97
msgid "Node kind"
msgstr "节点种类"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:145
msgid "Capability kinds"
msgstr "能力种类"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:152
msgid "`AtomicCell`, `OwnedBuffer` (not with `ReadOnly` access)"
msgstr "`AtomicCell`、`OwnedBuffer`（访问模式不能是 `ReadOnly`）"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:156
msgid "A node with an id, a label, a kind and an optional capability id."
msgstr "带有 id、标签、种类和可选能力 id 的节点。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:170
msgid "Creates a `Compute(plan)` node without a capability."
msgstr "创建一个不带能力的 `Compute(plan)` 节点。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:176
msgid "`spawn_node`, `join_node`, `send_node`, `recv_node`, `lock_node`, `unlock_node`, `wait_node`, `signal_node`, `barrier_node`, `read_shared_node` and `write_shared_node`"
msgstr "`spawn_node`、`join_node`、`send_node`、`recv_node`、`lock_node`、`unlock_node`、`wait_node`、`signal_node`、`barrier_node`、`read_shared_node` 和 `write_shared_node`"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:178
msgid "Create a node of the kind of the same name, with an id, a label and an optional capability id."
msgstr "创建同名种类的节点，参数为 id、标签和可选的能力 id。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:204
msgid "Edges"
msgstr "边"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:208
msgid "Why one node must run before another."
msgstr "为什么一个节点必须在另一个之前运行。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:219
msgid "All four kinds order their endpoints in the same way; the kind documents the reason and is passed to the runtime unchanged."
msgstr "四种边以相同的方式对端点排序；种类只说明原因，并原样传给运行时。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:224
msgid "A dependency from node `from` to node `to`: `to` may start only after `from` has completed."
msgstr "从节点 `from` 到节点 `to` 的依赖：`to` 只能在 `from` 完成后开始。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:236
msgid "`data_dependency`, `control_dependency`, `ownership_transfer_dependency` and `synchronization_dependency`"
msgstr "`data_dependency`、`control_dependency`、`ownership_transfer_dependency` 和 `synchronization_dependency`"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:238
msgid "Return `DataDependency`, `ControlDependency`, `OwnershipTransfer` and `SynchronizationDependency`."
msgstr "返回 `DataDependency`、`ControlDependency`、`OwnershipTransfer` 和 `SynchronizationDependency`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:252
msgid "A labelled task graph with an execution policy."
msgstr "带标签和执行策略的任务图。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:265
msgid "`Workflow::new` creates an empty graph; `policy` defaults to `@shared.native_policy()`."
msgstr "`Workflow::new` 创建一个空图；`policy` 默认为 `@shared.native_policy()`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:268
msgid "`Workflow::add_capability`, `Workflow::add_node` and `Workflow::add_edge`"
msgstr "`Workflow::add_capability`、`Workflow::add_node` 和 `Workflow::add_edge`"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:270
msgid "Append a capability, node or edge and return the same workflow."
msgstr "追加一个能力、节点或边，并返回同一个工作流。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:278
msgid "These methods push onto the workflow's arrays in place: the receiver and the result are the same value, and every other reference to the workflow sees the addition. They do not check anything."
msgstr "这些方法就地向工作流的数组追加元素：接收者与结果是同一个值，对该工作流的所有其他引用都能看到新增的内容。它们不做任何检查。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:282
msgid "`Workflow::label`, `Workflow::policy`, `Workflow::capabilities`, `Workflow::nodes` and `Workflow::edges`"
msgstr "`Workflow::label`、`Workflow::policy`、`Workflow::capabilities`、`Workflow::nodes` 和 `Workflow::edges`"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:284
msgid "Return the fields of a workflow. The arrays are the workflow's own arrays, not copies."
msgstr "返回工作流的各个字段。返回的数组就是工作流自己的数组，而不是副本。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:310
msgid "One problem found in a workflow."
msgstr "在工作流中发现的一个问题。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:337
msgid "Returns every issue of a workflow, or an empty array."
msgstr "返回工作流的所有问题，若没有则返回空数组。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:343
msgid "The checks, in the order their issues appear:"
msgstr "各项检查，按其问题出现的顺序："

#: manual/api/workflow.md:345
msgid "`EmptyWorkflow` when there are no nodes, then one `InvalidPolicy` per issue of `@shared.validate_policy` on the workflow's policy."
msgstr "没有节点时报告 `EmptyWorkflow`，然后对工作流策略运行 `@shared.validate_policy`，每个问题报告一个 `InvalidPolicy`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:347
msgid "For each capability: `UnsupportedCapability` for `Opaque`, `InvalidCapabilityAccess` when the access mode is not valid for the kind, and `DuplicateCapabilityId` when its id occurs more than once (reported once per occurrence)."
msgstr "对每个能力：`Opaque` 报告 `UnsupportedCapability`；访问模式对该种类无效时报告 `InvalidCapabilityAccess`；其 id 出现不止一次时报告 `DuplicateCapabilityId`（每次出现报告一次）。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:351
msgid "For each node: `DuplicateNodeId` (once per occurrence), `MissingNodeCapability` when the kind needs a capability and has none, `MissingCapability` when the named capability does not exist, an `InvalidChannelNode`, `InvalidMutexNode`, `InvalidCondvarNode` or `InvalidBarrierNode` when the capability has the wrong kind (an `InvalidDependency` with equal endpoints for the other node kinds), `UnsupportedSharedWrite` when a `WriteShared` node names a `ReadOnly` capability, and one `InvalidComputePlan` per issue of `@plan.validate` on a compute node's plan."
msgstr "对每个节点：`DuplicateNodeId`（每次出现一次）；种类需要能力却没有时报告 `MissingNodeCapability`；指定的能力不存在时报告 `MissingCapability`；能力种类不对时报告 `InvalidChannelNode`、`InvalidMutexNode`、`InvalidCondvarNode` 或 `InvalidBarrierNode`（其他节点种类则报告端点相同的 `InvalidDependency`）；`WriteShared` 节点指定了 `ReadOnly` 能力时报告 `UnsupportedSharedWrite`；对计算节点的计划运行 `@plan.validate`，每个问题报告一个 `InvalidComputePlan`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:360
msgid "For each edge: `SelfEdge` when `from == to`, `InvalidNodeReference` for each endpoint that is not a node, and `InvalidDependency` when either is not."
msgstr "对每条边：`from == to` 时报告 `SelfEdge`；每个不是节点的端点报告一个 `InvalidNodeReference`；任一端点不是节点时报告 `InvalidDependency`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:362
msgid "`CyclicDependency` when the graph has no node without incoming edges, or when two edges point in opposite directions between the same nodes."
msgstr "图中没有入边为零的节点，或者同一对节点之间有两条方向相反的边时，报告 `CyclicDependency`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:365
msgid "The cycle check in step 5 does not find every cycle: a cycle of three or more nodes that is reachable from a source passes. The native runtime checks for cycles completely and rejects such a graph when it is submitted. The [workflow design](../design/workflow.md) discusses both checks."
msgstr "第 5 步的环检查并不能找出所有的环：从某个源节点可达的、长度为三或以上的环会通过检查。原生运行时会完整地检查环，并在提交时拒绝这样的图。[工作流设计](../design/workflow.md)讨论了这两种检查。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:378
msgid "`is_invalid_compute_plan`, `is_cyclic_dependency`, `is_missing_capability` and `is_unsupported_shared_write`"
msgstr "`is_invalid_compute_plan`、`is_cyclic_dependency`、`is_missing_capability` 和 `is_unsupported_shared_write`"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:380
msgid "Test which issue a `WorkflowIssue` is."
msgstr "判断一个 `WorkflowIssue` 是哪种问题。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:389
msgid "`is_missing_capability` matches both `MissingCapability` and `MissingNodeCapability`."
msgstr "`is_missing_capability` 同时匹配 `MissingCapability` 和 `MissingNodeCapability`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:404
msgid "Submission"
msgstr "提交"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:408
msgid "The record of a submission: the workflow, the target backend, whether it was accepted and completed, and the issues found."
msgstr "提交的记录：工作流、目标后端、是否被接受、是否已完成，以及发现的问题。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:427
msgid "Validates a workflow and records whether the backend accepts it."
msgstr "验证工作流，并记录后端是否接受它。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:433
msgid "The submission is accepted exactly when `validate` returns no issue and the backend (default `Native`) is `Native`. `completed` is always `false`: `submit` does not run the workflow."
msgstr "当且仅当 `validate` 没有返回问题且后端（默认为 `Native`）是 `Native` 时，提交被接受。`completed` 总是 `false`：`submit` 不会运行工作流。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:454
msgid "Structural equality, promoted on every type of the package: `AccessMode`, `Capability`, `CapabilityKind`, `Edge`, `EdgeKind`, `Node`, `NodeKind`, `Submission`, `Workflow` and `WorkflowIssue`. Use `==` and `!=`."
msgstr "结构相等，作为方法提升到本包的每个类型上：`AccessMode`、`Capability`、`CapabilityKind`、`Edge`、`EdgeKind`、`Node`、`NodeKind`、`Submission`、`Workflow` 和 `WorkflowIssue`。请使用 `==` 和 `!=`。"

#: manual/api/workflow.md:464
msgid "Returns `\"workflow\"`."
msgstr "返回 `\"workflow\"`。"

#: manual/architecture.md:1
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: manual/architecture.md:3
