msgstr "计划和工作流在 MoonBit 中验证，并且只有同步模式下的原生后端能通过验证。"

#: manual/index.md:24
msgid "The executable kernels are element-wise doubling, sum, minimum and maximum reductions, and inclusive prefix sums over `Int` and `Int64`. The facade exposes the `Int` versions of doubling, sum and prefix sum."
msgstr "可执行的内核包括作用于 `Int` 和 `Int64` 的逐元素翻倍、求和、最小值和最大值归约，以及包含式前缀和。门面暴露了 `Int` 版本的翻倍、求和与前缀和。"

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "Workflow graphs run on a pthread scheduler in C that executes the synchronisation protocol of each node. Compute nodes are scheduled but do not yet run their plan."
msgstr "工作流图运行在 C 中基于 pthread 的调度器上，该调度器执行每个节点的同步协议。计算节点会被调度，但还不运行它们的计划。"

#: manual/index.md:30
msgid "The facade and `backend/native` build only for the `native` target; `plan`, `shared`, `workflow` and `backend/js` build for every target."
msgstr "门面和 `backend/native` 只能在 `native` 目标上构建；`plan`、`shared`、`workflow` 和 `backend/js` 可以在所有目标上构建。"

