#: manual/index.md:54
msgid "If you want to run something, start with the [core tutorial](tutorial/core.md): it doubles, sums and scans an array on the native backend and submits a small workflow. To understand what a plan or a workflow means before you build one, read the [plan tutorial](tutorial/plan.md) and the [workflow tutorial](tutorial/workflow.md). If you already use the library, the API pages list every public name, starting with the [core API](api/core.md). Contributors should read the [architecture guide](architecture.md) and the design pages, in particular the [native backend design](design/backend/native.md) for the threading and memory model, then the specification above."
msgstr "如果你想运行点什么，请从 [core 教程](tutorial/core.md)开始：它在原生后端上对数组做翻倍、求和与扫描，并提交一个小型工作流。若想在构建之前理解计划或工作流的含义，请阅读 [plan 教程](tutorial/plan.md)和 [workflow 教程](tutorial/workflow.md)。如果你已经在使用这个库，API 页面列出了每个公开名称，可从 [core API](api/core.md) 开始。贡献者应阅读[架构指南](architecture.md)和各设计页面，特别是关于线程和内存模型的[原生后端设计](design/backend/native.md)，然后阅读上面的规范。"

#: manual/index.md:64
msgid "Toolchain"
msgstr "工具链"

#: manual/index.md:66
msgid "The module uses the `moon.mod` and `moon.pkg` manifest syntax and needs MoonBit `moonc` 0.10 or later. Running the facade needs the `native` target and a C compiler; the build links the C runtime from the package's native stubs and uses POSIX threads. Building the standalone C runtime with OpenMP uses CMake, and the Node.js addon uses `node-gyp`; `scripts/check-env.sh` checks for all of them."
msgstr "本模块使用 `moon.mod` 与 `moon.pkg` 清单语法，需要 MoonBit `moonc` 0.10 或更高版本。运行门面需要 `native` 目标和 C 编译器；构建会从包的原生桩链接 C 运行时，并使用 POSIX 线程。以 OpenMP 构建独立的 C 运行时使用 CMake，Node.js 插件使用 `node-gyp`；`scripts/check-env.sh` 会检查所有这些工具。"

#: manual/index.md:73
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: manual/index.md:75
msgid "Add the module to your project:"
msgstr "把模块添加到你的项目中："

#: manual/index.md:81
msgid "Import the facade in the `moon.pkg` of a package that builds for the native target:"
msgstr "在一个为原生目标构建的包的 `moon.pkg` 中导入门面："

#: manual/index.md:92
msgid "The facade is then available as `@luna_thread`. Packages that only build plans or workflows can import `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/plan` or `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/workflow` on any target."
msgstr "之后即可通过 `@luna_thread` 使用门面。只构建计划或工作流的包可以在任何目标上导入 `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/plan` 或 `Luna-Flow/luna_thread/workflow`。"

