#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:1
msgid "backend/native tutorial"
msgstr "backend/native 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to call the native backend directly: run the typed kernels, reach the `Int64` and minimum and maximum kernels through the raw foreign functions, turn plans into native requests, and run a workflow on the C scheduler."
msgstr "本教程展示如何直接调用原生后端：运行带类型的内核，通过原始外部函数使用 `Int64` 内核以及最小值和最大值内核，把计划转换为原生请求，并在 C 调度器上运行工作流。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:10
msgid "Import the backend from a package that builds for the native target:"
msgstr "在一个为原生目标构建的包中导入该后端："

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:20
msgid "Compute prefix sums with three workers and chunks of two:"
msgstr "用三个工作线程、块大小为二来计算前缀和："

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:34
msgid "Find the minimum and maximum of `Int64` data"
msgstr "求 `Int64` 数据的最小值和最大值"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:36
msgid "The raw functions take the length explicitly and return the result directly:"
msgstr "原始函数显式接受长度，并直接返回结果："

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:47
msgid "Write into your own output array"
msgstr "写入你自己的输出数组"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:49
msgid "Map and scan write into an array you provide and return a status code, `0` on success:"
msgstr "映射和扫描写入你提供的数组，并返回状态码，成功时为 `0`："

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:62
msgid "Turn a plan into a request"
msgstr "把计划转换为请求"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:64
msgid "The `*_from_plan` functions check a plan and translate it to the backend's typed request:"
msgstr "`*_from_plan` 函数检查计划，并把它转换为后端的带类型请求："

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:80
msgid "Run a workflow"
msgstr "运行工作流"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:82
msgid "`submit_workflow_async` starts the graph on worker threads; `wait_workflow` blocks until it finishes. Because of the known bridge defect described in the [backend/native API](../../api/backend/native.md), this example is not compiled into the documentation tests:"
msgstr "`submit_workflow_async` 在工作线程上启动图；`wait_workflow` 阻塞直到它完成。由于 [backend/native API](../../api/backend/native.md) 中描述的已知桥接缺陷，这个示例没有编译进文档测试："

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:101
msgid "The kernels take the same three numbers $n$, $w$ and $c$, and the [native backend design](../../design/backend/native.md) derives how they split the input, why the results do not depend on $w$ and $c$ when they succeed, and when overflow is detected. To link the C runtime with OpenMP outside MoonBit, build `native/` with CMake as described in the [architecture guide](../../architecture.md)."
msgstr "内核都接受相同的三个数 $n$、$w$ 和 $c$；[原生后端设计](../../design/backend/native.md)推导了它们如何划分输入、为什么成功时结果与 $w$ 和 $c$ 无关，以及何时检测到溢出。若要在 MoonBit 之外以 OpenMP 链接 C 运行时，请按[架构指南](../../architecture.md)所述用 CMake 构建 `native/`。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:110
msgid "Every kernel needs $w \\ge \\lceil n / c \\rceil$, $w \\le n$ and $c \\le n$; otherwise it fails with `InvalidArgument` (or returns `0` for reductions)."
msgstr "每个内核都需要 $w \\ge \\lceil n / c \\rceil$、$w \\le n$ 和 $c \\le n$；否则以 `InvalidArgument` 失败（归约则返回 `0`）。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:112
msgid "The raw functions trust the `length` you pass. Passing more than the array holds reads past its end."
msgstr "原始函数信任你传入的 `length`。传入的值大于数组实际长度时，会读到数组末尾之外。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:114
msgid "The `moon` build does not enable OpenMP: the kernels run on the calling thread even though `supports_openmp()` returns `true`."
msgstr "`moon` 构建没有启用 OpenMP：即使 `supports_openmp()` 返回 `true`，内核也在调用线程上运行。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:116
msgid "Requests built from plans have empty buffers; nothing executes them yet."
msgstr "由计划构建的请求带有空缓冲区；目前没有任何东西执行它们。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:117
msgid "A workflow whose nodes block without being woken never finishes, and `wait_workflow` does not return."
msgstr "若工作流的节点阻塞后从未被唤醒，它就永远不会结束，`wait_workflow` 也不会返回。"

#: manual/tutorial/backend/native.md:122
msgid "The [backend/native API](../../api/backend/native.md) lists every function, including the raw ones. The [backend/native design](../../design/backend/native.md) describes the threading and memory model. The [core tutorial](../core.md) shows the same kernels through the facade."
msgstr "[backend/native API](../../api/backend/native.md) 列出了每个函数，包括原始函数。[backend/native 设计](../../design/backend/native.md)描述了线程和内存模型。[core 教程](../core.md)通过门面展示了同样的内核。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:1
msgid "core tutorial"
msgstr "core 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to run parallel integer kernels from MoonBit with the `luna_thread` facade, how to describe the same work as a plan that the library validates, and how to build and check a workflow graph. Everything runs on the native target."
msgstr "本教程展示如何借助 `luna_thread` 门面从 MoonBit 运行并行整数内核，如何把同样的工作描述为由库验证的计划，以及如何构建并检查工作流图。所有内容都在原生目标上运行。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:10
msgid "Add the module:"
msgstr "添加模块："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:16
msgid "Import the facade from a package that builds for the native target:"
msgstr "在一个为原生目标构建的包中导入门面："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:26
msgid "Sum an array with two workers that each take a chunk of up to three elements:"
msgstr "用两个工作线程对数组求和，每个线程处理至多三个元素的块："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:40
msgid "`moon test --target native` reports:"
msgstr "`moon test --target native` 报告："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:48
msgid "Choose the worker count and chunk size"
msgstr "选择工作线程数和块大小"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:50
msgid "The kernels split $n$ elements into $\\lceil n / c \\rceil$ chunks of at most $c$ elements and need one worker per chunk, so pick $c$ first and then $w = \\lceil n / c \\rceil$. Both must also be at most $n$."
msgstr "内核把 $n$ 个元素分成 $\\lceil n / c \\rceil$ 个至多 $c$ 个元素的块，每个块需要一个工作线程，所以先选 $c$，再取 $w = \\lceil n / c \\rceil$。两者都不能超过 $n$。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:68
msgid "Double the elements and handle overflow"
msgstr "把元素翻倍并处理溢出"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:70
msgid "`execute_map_i32` doubles every element and reports overflow as an error instead of wrapping around:"
msgstr "`execute_map_i32` 把每个元素翻倍，并把溢出作为错误报告，而不是回绕："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:88
msgid "Compute prefix sums"
msgstr "计算前缀和"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:90
msgid "`execute_scan_sum_i32` returns the running totals:"
msgstr "`execute_scan_sum_i32` 返回累计总和："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:102
msgid "Describe the work as a plan and validate it"
msgstr "把工作描述为计划并验证它"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:104
msgid "A plan records what should run without running it. Validation tells you whether the v1 runtime supports it:"
msgstr "计划记录应该运行什么，但不运行它。验证会告诉你 v1 运行时是否支持它："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:123
msgid "Build and check a workflow"
msgstr "构建并检查工作流"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:125
msgid "A workflow is a graph of tasks. This one spawns, computes the plan above and joins, with edges that fix the order:"
msgstr "工作流是由任务组成的图。这个工作流先派生，再计算上面的计划，最后汇合，并用边固定顺序："

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:150
msgid "This needs `\"Luna-Flow/luna_thread/workflow\"` in the imports as well, for `Edge`. `submit_workflow` validates and records the submission; it does not run the graph."
msgstr "为了使用 `Edge`，导入中还需要 `\"Luna-Flow/luna_thread/workflow\"`。`submit_workflow` 验证并记录提交；它不会运行图。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:156
msgid "To run a workflow's synchronisation protocol on real threads, submit it with `submit_workflow_async`, then `wait_workflow` and `drop_workflow`. The asynchronous path is experimental because of a known defect in the C bridge; read the warning in the [core API](../api/core.md) before you use it."
msgstr "要在真实线程上运行工作流的同步协议，请用 `submit_workflow_async` 提交，然后调用 `wait_workflow` 和 `drop_workflow`。由于 C 桥接层的一个已知缺陷，异步路径是实验性的；使用前请阅读 [core API](../api/core.md) 中的警告。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:161
msgid "For other element types and kernels, `backend/native` exposes the raw C entry points, including `Int64` and minimum and maximum reductions; see the [native backend tutorial](backend/native.md). For finer control over plans and graphs, use the `plan` and `workflow` packages directly: the [plan tutorial](plan.md) and the [workflow tutorial](workflow.md) build plans and graphs field by field. Packages that only describe work can import those two packages and build for every target."
msgstr "对于其他元素类型和内核，`backend/native` 暴露了原始的 C 入口，包括 `Int64` 以及最小值和最大值归约；参见[原生后端教程](backend/native.md)。若要更精细地控制计划和图，请直接使用 `plan` 和 `workflow` 包：[plan 教程](plan.md)和 [workflow 教程](workflow.md)逐字段地构建计划和图。只描述工作的包可以导入这两个包，并在所有目标上构建。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:171
msgid "The defaults `worker_count=1` and `chunk_size=1` only work for one-element inputs. For longer inputs the kernels return `Err(InvalidArgument)`, and `execute_reduce_sum_i32` returns `0`."
msgstr "默认值 `worker_count=1` 和 `chunk_size=1` 只适用于单元素输入。对于更长的输入，内核返回 `Err(InvalidArgument)`，`execute_reduce_sum_i32` 返回 `0`。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:174
msgid "`execute_reduce_sum_i32` returns `0` both for a sum of zero and for any failure. Check the input and parameters yourself, or use the scan and take the last element when you need to tell them apart."
msgstr "`execute_reduce_sum_i32` 在和为零以及任何失败时都返回 `0`。需要区分二者时，请自行检查输入和参数，或者改用扫描并取最后一个元素。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:177
msgid "Whether an `Int` sum overflows can depend on the chunking, because partial sums are checked: `[-1, 0, 2147483647, 1]` sums with `chunk_size=4` and fails with `chunk_size=2`."
msgstr "由于部分和会被检查，`Int` 求和是否溢出可能取决于分块方式：`[-1, 0, 2147483647, 1]` 在 `chunk_size=4` 时能求和，在 `chunk_size=2` 时却失败。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:180
msgid "`is_ready` does not check the worker-per-chunk condition, so a ready plan can still be rejected by a kernel."
msgstr "`is_ready` 不检查“每块一个工作线程”的条件，因此就绪的计划仍可能被内核拒绝。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:182
msgid "`javascript_policy()` aborts in v1, and `make_policy` rejects the JavaScript backend and asynchronous mode."
msgstr "`javascript_policy()` 在 v1 中会中止，`make_policy` 会拒绝 JavaScript 后端和异步模式。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:184
msgid "`Workflow::add_node` and the other builders change the workflow in place."
msgstr "`Workflow::add_node` 和其他构建方法会就地修改工作流。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:185
msgid "The facade builds only for the native target. Packages that import it need `supported_targets = \"native\"` or a native-only build."
msgstr "门面只能在原生目标上构建。导入它的包需要 `supported_targets = \"native\"`，或者只在原生目标上构建。"

#: manual/tutorial/core.md:190
msgid "The [core API](../api/core.md) lists every facade function with its exact semantics. The [core design](../design/core.md) explains why the facade is a set of free functions with defaults, and the [native backend design](../design/backend/native.md) explains how the kernels and the workflow scheduler use threads and memory. The [architecture guide](../architecture.md) shows how the packages and the C runtime fit together."
msgstr "[core API](../api/core.md) 列出了每个门面函数及其精确语义。[core 设计](../design/core.md)解释了为什么门面是一组带默认值的自由函数，[原生后端设计](../design/backend/native.md)解释了内核和工作流调度器如何使用线程和内存。[架构指南](../architecture.md)展示了各个包和 C 运行时如何组合在一起。"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:1
msgid "plan tutorial"
msgstr "plan 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to describe a data-parallel operation as a `Plan`, check it against the v1 subset, and read the reasons when a plan is rejected. Plans are plain data, so this package works on every target."
msgstr "本教程展示如何把数据并行操作描述为 `Plan`，按 v1 子集检查它，以及在计划被拒绝时阅读原因。计划是普通数据，因此这个包可以在所有目标上使用。"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:9
msgid "Import the package, and `shared` for policies:"
msgstr "导入该包，以及用于策略的 `shared`："

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:18
msgid "Build a map plan over eight `Int` values and validate it:"
msgstr "构建一个作用于八个 `Int` 值的映射计划并验证它："

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:30
msgid "Give a plan a policy"
msgstr "为计划指定策略"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:32
msgid "The default policy uses one worker and chunk size one. Build a parallel policy with `make_execution_policy` and pass it to the builder:"
msgstr "默认策略使用一个工作线程，块大小为一。用 `make_execution_policy` 构建一个并行策略，并把它传给构建函数："

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:45
msgid "Read why a plan is rejected"
msgstr "阅读计划被拒绝的原因"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:47
msgid "`validate` returns all problems at once, so you can report them together:"
msgstr "`validate` 一次返回所有问题，因此你可以把它们一起报告："

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:61
msgid "The fourth issue is `WorkerCountExceedsInput`: eight workers for four elements."
msgstr "第四个问题是 `WorkerCountExceedsInput`：四个元素却有八个工作线程。"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:64
msgid "Build an unusual plan by hand"
msgstr "手工构建不寻常的计划"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:66
msgid "`Plan::new` stores whatever you give it, which is how you test validation rules such as the ordering requirement of scans:"
msgstr "`Plan::new` 会保存你给它的任何东西，借此可以测试各种验证规则，例如扫描的顺序要求："

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:83
msgid "Inspect a plan"
msgstr "查看计划"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:85
msgid "Accessors return each field, and the kind predicates save a match:"
msgstr "访问器返回各个字段，种类谓词则省去了一次模式匹配："

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:99
msgid "Plans become executable through `backend/native`, whose `map_request_from_plan`, `reduce_request_from_plan` and `scan_request_from_plan` turn a valid plan into a typed request, and through workflows, where `@workflow.compute_node` embeds a plan in a task graph and `@workflow.validate` reports its issues as `InvalidComputePlan`. Write library code against `Plan` and `ValidationIssue` rather than against the facade, so it builds for every target."
msgstr "计划通过 `backend/native` 变得可执行：它的 `map_request_from_plan`、`reduce_request_from_plan` 和 `scan_request_from_plan` 把有效计划转换为带类型的请求；也可以通过工作流：`@workflow.compute_node` 把计划嵌入任务图，`@workflow.validate` 把计划的问题报告为 `InvalidComputePlan`。库代码应基于 `Plan` 和 `ValidationIssue` 而不是门面来编写，这样它可以在所有目标上构建。"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:109
msgid "`is_runnable` does not check that there is one worker per chunk ($w \\ge \\lceil n / c \\rceil$), which the native kernels require."
msgstr "`is_runnable` 不检查原生内核所要求的“每块一个工作线程”（$w \\ge \\lceil n / c \\rceil$）。"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:111
msgid "`reduce` and `scan` always preserve input order; to try other orderings use `Plan::new`."
msgstr "`reduce` 和 `scan` 总是保持输入顺序；要尝试其他顺序，请使用 `Plan::new`。"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:113
msgid "A scan plan has no kernel; the native scan is always a prefix sum."
msgstr "扫描计划没有内核；原生扫描总是前缀和。"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:114
msgid "The enumerations are read-only outside the package: write `@plan.i32_type()`, not `@plan.I32`, when you build a value. Matching on `@plan.I32` works."
msgstr "枚举类型在包外是只读的：构建值时请写 `@plan.i32_type()`，而不是 `@plan.I32`。对 `@plan.I32` 做模式匹配是可以的。"

#: manual/tutorial/plan.md:120
msgid "The [plan API](../api/plan.md) lists every rule of `validate`. The [plan design](../design/plan.md) explains what each plan kind computes and why scans need ordered input. The [workflow tutorial](workflow.md) puts plans into task graphs."
msgstr "[plan API](../api/plan.md) 列出了 `validate` 的每条规则。[plan 设计](../design/plan.md)解释了每种计划计算什么，以及为什么扫描需要有序的输入。[workflow 教程](workflow.md)把计划放进任务图。"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:1
msgid "shared tutorial"
msgstr "shared 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to build and check execution policies, ask what a backend declares it can do, and convert native status codes. These are the values every other package of `luna_thread` takes as input."
msgstr "本教程展示如何构建和检查执行策略、查询后端声明自己能做什么，以及转换原生状态码。这些是 `luna_thread` 其他所有包都接受的输入值。"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:9
msgid "Import the package:"
msgstr "导入该包："

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:17
msgid "Build a policy with four workers and chunks of 256 elements:"
msgstr "构建一个有四个工作线程、块大小为 256 个元素的策略："

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:29
msgid "Handle a rejected policy"
msgstr "处理被拒绝的策略"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:31
msgid "`make_execution_policy` returns the first problem it finds, so you can report it without aborting:"
msgstr "`make_execution_policy` 返回它发现的第一个问题，因此你可以报告它而不必中止："

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:55
msgid "Re-check a stored policy"
msgstr "重新检查已存储的策略"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:57
msgid "`validate_policy` lists every issue of a policy you already have, for example one read back from a workflow:"
msgstr "`validate_policy` 列出你已有策略的所有问题，例如从工作流中读回的策略："

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:67
msgid "Ask what a backend declares"
msgstr "查询后端的声明"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:78
msgid "Convert status codes"
msgstr "转换状态码"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:90
msgid "Policies flow into `@plan` builders, `@workflow.Workflow::new` and the facade's `make_policy`. The integer-coded request records (`NativeBuffer`, `NativeMapRequest` and the others) mirror the C structs and are useful when you write your own bindings to the C runtime; the [architecture guide](../architecture.md) lists the codes."
msgstr "策略会流入 `@plan` 的构建函数、`@workflow.Workflow::new` 以及门面的 `make_policy`。整数编码的请求记录（`NativeBuffer`、`NativeMapRequest` 等）镜像了 C 结构体，在你为 C 运行时编写自己的绑定时很有用；[架构指南](../architecture.md)列出了这些编码。"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:98
msgid "`ExecutionPolicy::new` and `javascript_policy` abort on a rejected policy; `javascript_policy` always aborts in v1. Use `make_execution_policy` when the arguments come from outside."
msgstr "`ExecutionPolicy::new` 和 `javascript_policy` 在策略被拒绝时会中止；`javascript_policy` 在 v1 中总是中止。参数来自外部时，请使用 `make_execution_policy`。"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:101
msgid "`RuntimeCapabilities::for_backend` is a fixed table. The JavaScript row does not mean the JavaScript backend runs anything."
msgstr "`RuntimeCapabilities::for_backend` 是一张固定的表。JavaScript 一行并不意味着 JavaScript 后端会运行任何东西。"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:103
msgid "`native_status_from_code` maps every unknown code, including the workflow statuses 8 to 14, to `InvalidArgument`. Keep the raw code when you need it."
msgstr "`native_status_from_code` 把每个未知编码（包括工作流状态码 8 到 14）映射为 `InvalidArgument`。需要原始编码时请保留它。"

#: manual/tutorial/shared.md:108
msgid "The [shared API](../api/shared.md) lists every value, and the [shared design](../design/shared.md) explains the policy rules and the status code mapping. The [plan tutorial](plan.md) uses policies in plans."
msgstr "[shared API](../api/shared.md) 列出了每个值，[shared 设计](../design/shared.md)解释了策略规则和状态码映射。[plan 教程](plan.md)在计划中使用策略。"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:1
msgid "workflow tutorial"
msgstr "workflow 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows you how to describe concurrent work as a task graph: you declare capabilities, add nodes that use them, order the nodes with edges, and let `validate` check the result before anything runs. The package works on every target."
msgstr "本教程展示如何把并发工作描述为任务图：声明能力，添加使用它们的节点，用边为节点排序，并在任何东西运行之前让 `validate` 检查结果。这个包可以在所有目标上使用。"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:10
msgid "Import the package, and `shared` and `plan` when you need policies and compute nodes:"
msgstr "导入该包；需要策略和计算节点时，再导入 `shared` 和 `plan`："

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:21
msgid "A fork-join graph with two nodes:"
msgstr "一个只有两个节点的派生-汇合图："

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:35
msgid "Pass work through a channel"
msgstr "通过通道传递工作"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:37
msgid "Nodes that communicate name a capability by id. A channel is used with `MoveOnly` access, and the edge from `send` to `recv` makes the receive wait for the send:"
msgstr "相互通信的节点通过 id 指定能力。通道以 `MoveOnly` 访问模式使用，从 `send` 到 `recv` 的边使接收等待发送完成："

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:58
msgid "Protect a critical section"
msgstr "保护临界区"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:60
msgid "A mutex is used with `SynchronizeOnly` access by a `Lock` and an `Unlock` node:"
msgstr "互斥锁以 `SynchronizeOnly` 访问模式，由一个 `Lock` 节点和一个 `Unlock` 节点使用："

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:82
msgid "The write names capability `2`, which the graph does not declare. Adding an `AtomicCell` with `ReadWrite` access as capability `2` fixes it."
msgstr "写入节点指定了能力 `2`，而图中没有声明它。把一个访问模式为 `ReadWrite` 的 `AtomicCell` 作为能力 `2` 加入即可修正。"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:85
msgid "Embed a plan"
msgstr "嵌入计划"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:87
msgid "A compute node carries a plan, and the plan's own issues are reported with the node id:"
msgstr "计算节点携带一个计划，计划自身的问题会连同节点 id 一起报告："

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:104
msgid "Submit a workflow"
msgstr "提交工作流"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:106
msgid "`submit` validates and records whether the chosen backend accepts the graph:"
msgstr "`submit` 验证图，并记录所选后端是否接受它："

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:121
msgid "To run a graph, pass it to `@native.submit_workflow_async` (or the facade's `submit_workflow_async`) on the native target; the [native backend tutorial](backend/native.md) shows how, and the [native backend design](../design/backend/native.md) explains which node kinds can block and what wakes them. Because `validate` returns every issue, a tool can show all problems of a graph at once; the predicates `is_missing_capability`, `is_cyclic_dependency`, `is_invalid_compute_plan` and `is_unsupported_shared_write` group the common ones."
msgstr "要运行图，请在原生目标上把它传给 `@native.submit_workflow_async`（或门面的 `submit_workflow_async`）；[原生后端教程](backend/native.md)展示了做法，[原生后端设计](../design/backend/native.md)解释了哪些节点种类会阻塞以及什么会唤醒它们。由于 `validate` 返回所有问题，工具可以一次展示图的所有问题；谓词 `is_missing_capability`、`is_cyclic_dependency`、`is_invalid_compute_plan` 和 `is_unsupported_shared_write` 对常见问题做了分组。"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:132
msgid "`add_capability`, `add_node` and `add_edge` change the workflow in place. Two variables bound to the same workflow see the same nodes."
msgstr "`add_capability`、`add_node` 和 `add_edge` 会就地修改工作流。绑定到同一个工作流的两个变量看到的是同样的节点。"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:134
msgid "`validate` misses cycles of three or more nodes when some node has no incoming edge; the native runtime rejects them on submission."
msgstr "当某个节点没有入边时，`validate` 会漏掉三个或更多节点构成的环；原生运行时会在提交时拒绝它们。"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:136
msgid "A `Recv`, `Lock` or `Send` that can run before its partner may block forever on the native runtime. Order such nodes with edges."
msgstr "可能先于其配对节点运行的 `Recv`、`Lock` 或 `Send` 可能会在原生运行时上永远阻塞。请用边为这类节点排序。"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:138
msgid "A single `Barrier` node in a group fails at run time with status `14`; a barrier needs at least two nodes at the same depth."
msgstr "组内只有一个 `Barrier` 节点时，会在运行时以状态码 `14` 失败；一个屏障需要在同一深度上至少有两个节点。"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:140
msgid "`RwLock` and `Semaphore` pass `validate` but are rejected by the native runtime."
msgstr "`RwLock` 和 `Semaphore` 能通过 `validate`，但会被原生运行时拒绝。"

#: manual/tutorial/workflow.md:145
msgid "The [workflow API](../api/workflow.md) lists every check of `validate`. The [workflow design](../design/workflow.md) gives the graph model and the cycle checks. The [core tutorial](core.md) builds workflows through the facade."
msgstr "[workflow API](../api/workflow.md) 列出了 `validate` 的每项检查。[workflow 设计](../design/workflow.md)给出了图模型和环检查。[core 教程](core.md)通过门面构建工作流。"

